  "description": "<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"dc2244b1-8902-4d53-85fc-5050b489fb44\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"41\" data-end=\"489\"><strong data-start=\"41\" data-end=\"51\">Vampyr</strong> is een duistere en verhalend sterke <strong data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"101\">actie-RPG</strong> voor de Nintendo Switch, gesitueerd in het Londen van 1918. Je kruipt in de huid van Dr. Jonathan Reid, een arts die is veranderd in een vampier en moet balanceren tussen het redden van levens en het voeden van zijn eigen duistere natuur. De keuzes die je maakt hebben directe invloed op het verhaal, de wereld en de personages, wat zorgt voor een intense en moreel beladen spelervaring.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"570\">De game verkeert in <strong data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"529\">In Nette Staat</strong>, is volledig getest en direct speelbaar.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"575\">\r\n<p data-start=\"577\" data-end=\"592\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"592\">Voordelen</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"776\">\r\n<li data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"635\">\r\n<p data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"635\">🧛‍♂️ Donkere en meeslepende actie-RPG</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"686\">\r\n<p data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"686\">📖 Verhaal gedreven gameplay met morele keuzes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"729\">\r\n<p data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"729\">🌆 Unieke setting in historisch Londen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"776\">\r\n<p data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"776\">⚔️ Diepgaande gevechts- en RPG-mechanieken</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"778\" data-end=\"781\">\r\n<p data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"803\">📋 <strong data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"803\">Specificaties</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"964\">\r\n<li data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"833\">\r\n<p data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"833\">Platform: Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"851\">\r\n<p data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"851\">Titel: Vampyr</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"872\">\r\n<p data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"872\">Genre: Actie-RPG</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"900\">\r\n<p data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"900\">Spelmodus: Singleplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"901\" data-end=\"938\">\r\n<p data-start=\"903\" data-end=\"938\">Taal: Engels (menu’s en gameplay)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"964\">\r\n<p data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"964\">Staat: In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"969\">\r\n<p data-start=\"971\" data-end=\"989\">📦 <strong data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"989\">Meegeleverd</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1037\">\r\n<li data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1037\">\r\n<p data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1037\">Nintendo Switch game <strong data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1037\">(los, zonder doosje)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1042\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1105\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1066\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1069\">Incl. Garantie: <strong data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1105\" data-is-last-node=\"\">1 maand garantie</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-light my-2 flex gap-10 border-t pt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden h-12 w-12 rounded-lg\"> </div>\r\n</div